  "story_path": "user_stories/workflow-herdr-layout-ports.md",
  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "AC1",
      "text": "`samePath` resolves canonical paths via `fs.realpath` so symlink aliases compare equal, and fails with `invalid_path_input` when either path is empty."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC2",
      "text": "`validateHerdrInventory` accepts valid scoped `workspace_list`, `tab_list` and `pane_list` replies and fails with `invalid_tab_inventory` when a scoped tab row belongs to another workspace."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC3",
      "text": "`withHerdrLayoutLock` acquires and releases the layout lock for an available directory and fails immediately with `herdr_layout_busy` when a live owner holds the lock."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC4",
      "text": "`recoverHerdrRunLayout` refreshes `restartTerminal: true` when a verified workspace's root terminal ID changed after a server restart, and fails with `herdr_layout_identity_changed` when the root tab has split into multiple panes."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC5",
      "text": "`openHerdrRunLayout` opens the assigned worktree from a verified parent workspace, reserves missing panes via `herdr.beforeCreate`, creates the area tab, checkpoints custody, and fails with `repository_parent_unverified` when the parent lookup is unverified."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC6",
      "text": "`closeHerdrRunLayout` verifies creation custody (`createdWorkspaceId === workspaceId`), caller pane protection and idle shell occupancy before closing the run workspace, and fails with `run_shell_caller` when `callerPaneId` matches the root pane."
    },
    {
      "id": "AC7",
      "text": "`closeHerdrRepoLayoutIfIdle` retains an adopted parent workspace (`createdByPdd: false`) returning `closed: false`, and fails with `invalid_herdr_layout_input` when `repository` or `commonDir` is empty."
    }
  ],
